Super Robin Hood — Reverse Engineering Project
================================================

This repository is a mixture of original work (reverse engineering,
documentation, and Rust / TypeScript tooling) and third-party material
(the original game, its source code, and its assets). Different parts
carry different licenses. Read carefully before redistributing.

